<header class="lead"><p class="kicker">ARGENTINE LITERATURE · DOCUMENTARY BIOGRAPHY</p><h1>José Hernández: <em>The Writer Behind Martín Fierro</em></h1><p class="deck">José Hernández did not write about the Argentine countryside from a distance. His experiences as a rural worker, soldier, journalist, and politician gave him a sharp view of the tensions that would shape his most famous poem.</p><p class="metadata">1834–1886 · Argentina · Biography and historical sources</p></header>
