<aside class="facts"><h2>José Hernández at a glance</h2><dl><div><dt>Full name</dt><dd>José Rafael Hernández y Pueyrredón</dd></div><div><dt>Born</dt><dd>November 10, 1834 — Perdriel, Buenos Aires Province</dd></div><div><dt>Died</dt><dd>October 21, 1886 — Belgrano, Buenos Aires</dd></div><div><dt>Known for</dt><dd><em>El gaucho Martín Fierro</em> (1872) and <em>La vuelta de Martín Fierro</em> (1879)</dd></div><div><dt>Other work</dt><dd>Journalism, politics, <em>Vida del Chacho</em>, and <em>Instrucción del estanciero</em></dd></div></dl></aside>
